---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Commerce Disclosure | Where Horses Run"
  description="Commerce disclosure for optional tip payments on Where Horses Run."
>
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <p class="hero__eyebrow">Payments</p>
    <h1 id="page-title">Commerce Disclosure</h1>
    <p class="hero__summary">Information prepared for optional tip payments in Japan. Payment processing is not currently enabled.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section-grid" aria-label="Commerce disclosure">
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Operator information</h2>
      <p>The operator's legal name, operating address, and telephone number will be provided without delay upon request through the Contact page before payment is enabled, in accordance with the applicable disclosure rules for mail-order transactions in Japan.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Site and service</h2>
      <p>Where Horses Run is a free horse-racing information website operated under the badjoke-lab name. Optional tips are payments in appreciation for information and content already provided; they do not purchase betting services, race predictions, odds, racecards, prizes, memberships, or preferential access.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Price and currency</h2>
      <p>If tips are enabled, the supporter chooses the available tip amount and the currency is displayed before payment. No recurring subscription is planned.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Additional charges</h2>
      <p>No shipping charge applies. Any internet access, mobile data, foreign-exchange, card-issuer, or other charges imposed independently by a user's provider are the user's responsibility.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Payment timing and method</h2>
      <p>If enabled, payment will be processed at the time the supporter confirms the payment using the payment methods displayed by the payment processor.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Delivery</h2>
      <p>No physical goods are shipped and no paid membership or future content entitlement is delivered in exchange for a tip. The tip relates to free content already available on the site.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Refunds and cancellation</h2>
      <p>See the <a href="/refund/">Refund Policy</a>. For duplicate, mistaken, or disputed payments, use the <a href="/contact/">Contact</a> page.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
